  ]

  #sol-item(10, "C", dense: true, pad: 15.82pt)[
    C — cattle is always plural, so the verb is were. Was, has been and is are all singular forms and cannot follow cattle.
  ]

  #sol-item(11, "D", dense: true, pad: 15.82pt)[
